cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or model, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Oil Palm Crown Detection & Counting from UAV RGB Orthomosaics"
abstract: >-
  A YOLOv8s single-class detector and geospatial pipeline that detects and counts individual
  oil palms in drone RGB orthomosaics and produces a GIS-ready palm inventory. Used in
  production to count 718,751 palms over 12,166.6 ha.
